    {
      "id": "fixed-b8660ca03c1edfb5",
      "text": "Down! Handout, five-four."
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-3d70faea9d93f048",
      "text": "For Kinect-style play, enable the camera on your court screen. Step back with your arms and body in view. Lunge and swing your racket arm. The red player follows your movement. Choose the front or back camera for your screen setup."
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-c028d9d29fe82108",
      "text": "Game and match!"
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-e5e3283fe7ba41b8",
      "text": "Love all. Play!"
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-909c9abbb855bc2a",
      "text": "Nick! Ten-eight, match ball!"
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-55cabe6eef92a31e",
      "text": "Play with your phone as a Wii-style racket. Pair it with the court screen and allow motion sensors. Fold it if you have a foldable. Hold securely with room to swing. Your arm movement and racket face shape the on-screen stroke. Ordinary phones work too."
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-6eafa2e6e7f3a9a8",
      "text": "Quick note — you don't run to the ball in this game; your player does that. Your only job is shot selection: keys one to five, a click, or spacebar. Call the spin!"
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-d53ee735094e4077",
      "text": "Receiver, give the server room."
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-e688c7fd14a85661",
      "text": "Server, use the left box."
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-0183eb26b74e2625",
      "text": "Server, use the right box."
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-1faa612e13308eb6",
      "text": "Stop play! Yes, Let. Safety reminder: always call a Let when obstructed instead of striking your opponent."
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-b792e29bafe68729",
      "text": "The user is always represented in the game as the red player."
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-b5f6c30bc5e5843b",
      "text": "The user is always represented in the game as the red player. Squash is physical chess. Keep rails tight to the wall. Send drives and lobs deep, beyond the service box. Volley when the opening is there. Move your opponent before you attack. Watch the red player, then try the shots yourself."
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-009dc94f0d322934",
      "text": "Welcome to Virtual Squash!"
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-03516c05f921546b",
      "text": "Welcome to Virtual Squash! Love all. Play!"
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-e3d5b6f27562a4a0",
      "text": "Welcome to Virtual Squash! The user is always represented in the game as the red player. Love all. Play!"
    },
    {
      "id": "fixed-2d82471065b3e0b3",
      "text": "Yes, Let! Play a let."
